// ------------------------------------------------------------
// OPEN MENU: L2 + Options (controller) / Backspace (keyboard)
// NAVIGATE: D-Pad Up/Down | SELECT: Cross/Space | BACK: Circle/Esc
// ADJUST VALUES: Left/Right (±1)
//
// MODULES:
// - Always Run: Automatically sprints when pushing the left stick forward past a threshold. Toggle: L1+Down
// - Auto Run: Runs forward when active. Toggle: L1+Up
// - Mash: Spams CROSS, SQUARE, CIRCLE or TRIANGLE. Can be useful for QTE. Toggle: L1+Right
// - Fishing: Moves the right stick a full circle to reel in fish. Reels on L2+R2. Toggle: L1+Left
// - Horse: Horse sprinting helper. Hold X to spam it so the horse gets to full speed, release it and let the script auto refresh the sprint. Toggle: L1+Circle
//
